| !MesaLibs: riscos-mesa's shared libraries (OSMesa, EGL, GLU, GLUT, SDL 2
| and OpenAL) for "mixed" programs, which have UnixLib linked in and load
| these with !SharedLibs. Keep one copy, in !Boot.Resources: every program
| using it then shares one copy of each library in memory.
Set MesaLibs$Dir <Obey$Dir>
Set MesaLibs$Path <MesaLibs$Dir>.lib.
| Lift RISC OS 5's 128 MB clamp on dynamic areas given a maximum size, as
| !GTKLibs does, before any program creates SOManager's library area (it
| can't grow past the size it's created with): OS_DynamicArea 8,0,-1,0.
| The setting is system-wide; R1 and R3 are left as they are.
/<MesaLibs$Dir>.DAClamp
